Recommends: wl-clipboard, wtype, xclip
Description: Direct emoji picker and typing utility for Linux (X11 & Wayland)
 EmojiTyper is a fast, responsive emoji selector and typing helper that allows
 you to search and type Unicode emojis directly into any focused window with
 global hotkey support (Super+.).
